usage: castform [-h] <command> ...

Castform CLI

positional arguments:
  <command>
    login     Sign in via your browser
    logout    Clear the cached session
    whoami    Show the current login
    runs      Inspect training runs
    stop      Stop (cancel) a run you own
    validate  Verify an env on a real-rollout subset; show rewards + errors
    launch    Validate, upload, and launch a training run
    data      Dataset utilities
    corpus    Corpus utilities for RAG envs
    setup     Sign in + scaffold this project for a coding agent

options:
  -h, --help  show this help message and exit
